Mori Emi-chan
Sannou Maruaki-kun

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:42.060
Sannou Maruaki-kun
Mori Emi-chan

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.990
Now that you mention it, I think I've seen her before.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:46.810
You see?

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:51.240
I'm sure this isn't the kind of place parents want to take their children.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:56.350
But what could have happened to Hikaru-chan?

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.770
I kinda liked Shouta.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:01.930
He was always wandering around this place.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:04.620
I can't believe this accident.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:11.040
Because we have no parents, we're really happy when someone's nice to us.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:16.160
No... I do think of you as a parent, Riko.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:17.550
Shiha Hikaru

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:18.650
It's OK.
Shiha Hikaru

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:19.280
Shiha Hikaru

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:26.030
Did you hear about Hikaru-chan's ceremony?

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:28.600
You wanna come along?

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:32.010
Let's say goodbye to her.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:33.290
Idiot!

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:34.350
What did you say?

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.360
It was major accident!

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.300
People from television are going to be there!

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:45.350
Wouldn't you feel sorry for Hikaru if they knew she hung out with orphans like us?

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:50.190
Unlike you, I can see what's going on.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:52.310
But...

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.450
I didn't know you were here, Oori!

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:11.480
Just the man I need.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:16.250
I wanted to offer you all these figurines.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.680
Do you really think I would want those?!

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:20.840
I thought you liked those.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:35.060
Could this rain be tears for the loss of this young one's life?

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:46.760
What happened to Hikaru-chan?

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.550
What's this?!

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:29.260
What's wrong?!

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:30.870
Out of the way!

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.260
What was that voice?

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:32.990
What happened?

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:33.910
What's wrong?!

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:44.680
Have I reached the local Kougou chapter?

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:47.950
I am Nakamura from the Shinkou-temple.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.170
Call an ambulance!

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.440
He's at it again.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:02.590
How could you make a flamethrower with an alcohol-lamp?

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:05.170
I'm sorry for being so inexperienced.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.890
Do you think that's the problem?

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:08.290
Hey, master!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.470
This part time worker is useless!

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:12.670
Master?

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.790
It came back from the dead...

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:18.100
One of the children from the accident.

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:18.420
Huh?

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.070
<i>A miracle has occurred.</i>

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:23.470
<i>The deceased Hikaru-chan is alive again.</i>

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:24.560
Hikaru-chan?

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:25.610
<i>She is breathing and her condition is stable.</i>

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.630
Doesn't matter.
<i>She is breathing and her condition is stable.</i>

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.300
A beautiful girl saved is always a good thing.
<i>She is breathing and her condition is stable.</i>

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:28.670
A beautiful girl saved is always a good thing.

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:29.020
<i>Hikaru-chan is being taken away by an ambulance.</i>

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:29.920
Behave!
<i>Hikaru-chan is being taken away by an ambulance.</i>

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:30.520
<i>Hikaru-chan is being taken away by an ambulance.</i>

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.250
O-Okay.
<i>Hikaru-chan is being taken away by an ambulance.</i>

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:31.780
<i>Hikaru-chan is being taken away by an ambulance.</i>

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:32.770
OPEN

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:34.330
CLOSED

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:35.480
Bye.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:36.750
I'll be going now.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.850
Are you sure you're not going?

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:54.950
Shiha Hikaru-chan

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.800
They reported that they found their corpses after the accident.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.830
Nijou Kasaharu-kun

00:04:58.830 --> 00:04:59.850
You probably won't even recognize the different parts of their bodies.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:02.810
Sannou Maruaki-kun

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.710
That's this world's implicit rule.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.430
The district responsible is probably already working on it.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.210
Common people like us can't do anything to help.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.140
This district's responsible is Tagami Keisei, right?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:17.630
Yeah.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:19.630
Did you know?

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.870
That part-time worker is Keisei's little brother.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.030
But his family name is Kagami.

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:29.380
He is a boy he took in.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:34.880
He wasn't given the name Tagami, so his fate wouldn't have the burden of the Kougon-cult.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:38.460
That's why he grew up with one different character in his name.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:41.220
You know Tagami Keisei?

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.470
Why would that boy want to work here?

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:44.880
How would I know?

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:49.510
In any case, we just have to look after him for a while.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.240
That's what we do anyway, isn't it.

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.540
What's going on here?

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:05.860
Looks like something big.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.920
What's the matter?

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:29.900
Come.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:34.350
I just need to hand this over to the nurse.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:35.950
What do you want with me?

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:37.710
Huh?

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.010
That girl is...

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.410
She's the one that died and came back.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.070
Just like Hikaru-chan.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.590
There is no need to check twice.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.480
It's already on the move.

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:29.170
I see.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:30.950
Are you okay on your own?

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:32.600
I'll be okay.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.610
Where are you calling from anyway?

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.570
I wonder who she's calling.

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:44.570
I don't think it's possible but...

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.180
In any case, dispose of it as soon as possible.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.230
Well then, it's this way.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:00.750
It must be hard.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:01.970
She's just a child...

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:03.600
Is Makina-chan alright?

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:04.070
It is none of your concern.
Is Makina-chan alright?

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:05.620
It is none of your concern.

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:02.380
There's no time to play hide and seek any further.

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:06.170
Is that really the shape you wanted to become?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.920
Using a child's body means you have no sense of design!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.660
I'm going to dispose of your evil.

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.280
Help me.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:43.360
What are you doing?

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:44.430
It's you.

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:47.780
We met the other day in the woods.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.050
Go over there.

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:51.280
What are you doing?

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:52.960
Just go!

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.460
Help me!

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.370
Help me.

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:03.570
Quickly, please!

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.140
Quickly!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:13.420
Yeah.

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:34.020
What about the other children?

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:35.420
Yeah.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.900
Two bodies of the children that passed away in that accident have disappeared.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.470
Hikaru-chan turned during that ceremony.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.710
But the other two turned into Corpses unnoticed.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.410
It seems like they've gotten away.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:51.490
How could that many Corpses be born at the same time?

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:53.830
It took us a while to report it to the families but,

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.420
we'll intercept them right away.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:58.280
You go after the remaining Corpses, Keisei.

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:01.090
I'll take care of the one from the hospital.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:02.590
I'll chase it.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.210
Did you get hurt?

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:06.910
If a healer isn't by your side it—

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.210
It's not such a bad wound!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:10.470
It healed already.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:12.080
Drink!

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:33.910
Let's play, let's play!

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:53.230
Shouldn't you go home?

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:54.720
No.

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:55.620
I can't.

00:11:58.690 --> 00:11:59.660
I see.

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:02.020
That girl could come after you.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:03.960
But...

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:09.680
Over here.

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:12.630
Where do you want to go?

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:19.600
The papers said the bones have been buried and her organs taken out.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.780
What could this mean?

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.210
It's using that dead child's body to move.

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:32.720
It just wants to play.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:35.760
It probably just wants to be around.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:52.470
Poster: Let's all play together!

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.220
Play?

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.860
Park

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:34.400
Let me go.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.580
What are you guys?

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.200
Corpses.

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:49.010
Corpses?

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:54.410
Deceased ones with strong attachments can start moving as undead.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:56.870
That's what we call a Corpse.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.140
Not even a single wound remains...

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:01.640
...on the bodies of the children who died in that accident.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.460
Didn't that look strange to you?

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.530
You came back to life too.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.360
And you are moving.

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:11.390
Are you a Corpse too?

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:14.670
A Corpse is death in person.

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.010
And for that they want to bring death upon men.

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:19.860
I am that which fights death.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.070
The undead that exterminates the undead.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.360
Shikabane Hime!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:29.690
Play!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.170
You must play!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:39.850
A Corpse is...

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.040
...unable to die until you...

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.960
...destroy their brain or scatter them into pieces.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:46.350
Are you ready?

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.430
Play!

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:16.170
That...

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:18.910
All of that is just for fun?

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:28.050
You are my little doll now.

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:29.760
I see...

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.010
I understand it now.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:34.990
Why the children that died in the same accident turned into three Corpses.

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:38.240
They were all strongly attached to the same thing.

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:39.930
They wanted to play more.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:41.700
They wanted to keep on playing.

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:45.210
They were actually just one Corpse.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.860
Hikaru-chan!

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:49.650
Come and play with me!

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:55.750
I've got something to give to you!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.760
What is it hesitating for?

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:16.430
Acting like a child now...

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.960
...won't spare you from your punishment!

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:43.060
Good.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:44.680
You did well, Minai.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:47.600
Are you alright, Makina?!

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:50.520
I'll finish the rest of the job.

00:16:57.980 --> 00:16:59.190
Hikaru-chan?

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.070
Here.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:08.040
Hand over the Corpse.

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:14.340
Didn't you see it?

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.110
That girl is a monster.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.060
Aren't you a monster too?

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:20.970
That's right.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:25.270
Hand it over please.

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:52.830
Thank you.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:57.260
That...

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.370
What's that in your left hand?

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:02.980
That girl's friend asked me...

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:05.790
...to deliver this to her.

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:09.810
Could the Corpse have stopped moving because it felt that?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:11.450
What is it?

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.880
Go after him, Minai.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.860
He must be observed after knowing this much.

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.560
There's no need.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.400
We must be aware of the common man.

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.000
That's my little brother.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:49.830
Didn't you know that?

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:53.300
So why did you make such a face?

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:00.290
Because he's a commoner.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.480
Ah well, just forget about it.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.110
I'll watch over him.

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:10.530
I even know the poses of his favorite Gravure Idols.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.270
Some like this.

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.940
And like this.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.450
We'll leave it up to you.

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:17.780
Makina-chan, are you wounded?

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:25.510
Thank you.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:27.690
The water stinks, right?

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:28.810
It's not that...

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:30.570
It's about your brother, Keisei.

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:34.040
He told me the same thing after I disposed of that Corpse.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:35.890
But why?

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:42.570
Because you drew your gun, he was able to let her go.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:45.120
If you didn't do that...

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.940
...he wouldn't have been able to hand it over to you.

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:49.550
Even knowing that it was a monster.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.490
No matter what.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:53.910
That's why you killed it.

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:09.430
That's why he thanked you.

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:11.890
That's the kind of guy Oori is.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:24.910
To be continued

00:21:55.590 --> 00:21:56.440
Oori...

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:59.350
Are you unable to forget about that woman?

00:21:59.780 --> 00:22:00.740
Those eyes...

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:01.980
Those lips...

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:04.940
Or perhaps the smell of death that surrounds that woman?

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:06.000
What could it be?

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:06.090
The voice of the night
What could it be?

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:06.500
The voice of the night

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:09.040
Did the voice of the night invite you?
The voice of the night

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:10.340
The voice of the night
